    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated along a lovely country road close to Nurney and Kildare Town, this charming home ensures privacy and peaceful living.\nBuilt 25 years ago, it was constructed, fitted and furnished to the highest standards. It has been maintained and continually upgraded throughout.\n\nKildare village, M7, Kildare town & Athy are only 11 kms away.\nNurney village is a mere 4 kms\nAccess to the M9 is only 20 kms\n\nIt presents in turn key condition.\n\nViewings are welcome by appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.63 x 4.56\nPorcelin tiled floor. Cloak press. Recessed lighting. Coving. understairs storage. Carpeted stairwell\n\nLounge - 4.81 x 4.49\nFeature wood / Wrought iron fireplace.Polished hardwood floor.Coving. Bay Window.Curtains & Pole\n\nKitchen / Diner - 5.96 x 3.24\nFitted floor & wall units, integrated appliances.Wooden ceiling with recessed lighting.Porcelin Tiled floor\n\nSunroom - 4.09 x3.41\nVelux Windows with blinds.French doors to cobblelock patio\n\nUtility Room - 3.98 x1.69\nFitted floor & wall units.Plumbing.Tiled floor.\n\nBack Hall - 1.58 x 1.66\nTiled Floor\n\nGuest W.C. - 2.28 x1.70\nToilet. Sink. Bath. Storage UnitTiled Floor & Walls\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.52 x 4.76\nBay window. carpeted.Curtains & Pole.Double wardrobe & dressing table\n\nEnsuite Off - 2.26 x0.88\nToilet, sink, shower, wall mirror, tiled floor & walls\n\nLanding - 5.035x2.116\nWooden floor. Airing & Linen Press.Radiator Cover.Recessed lights.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.695 x 3.260\nCarpeted. Curtains & Pole.Centre & Recessed lights.Velux Window with Blind.Walk in Wardrobe offEnsuite Off\n\nEnsuite Off - 1.58x3.23\nToilet, Vanity, Sink , Shower. Velux Window.Heated Towel Rail.Tiled Floor\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.01 x 4.06\nWooden Floor.Centre & received lighting.Curtains & pole.Velux Window.Wardrobe.\n\nStudy - 1.60 x2.13\nWooden Floors.Velux Window.Access to attic storage.\n\nShower Room - 1.93 x 1.85\nToilet. Vanity Sink.Wall Mirror.Shower.\n\nDouble Garage - 7.89x5.17\nUp and over door.WC Off40sq m\n\n"
